      "content": "You don't get it. You're just talking like a book. There is no 'healing' from this. The honor is gone. If I let them take me, I'll just be a broken, hollow shell of a man for them to mock. If I take my own life now, at least I die as the man I used to be. Tell me the truth... as my comrade... wouldn't that be a more honorable end than letting them humiliate me?",
